---
import { publicAsset } from '../utils/publicAsset';
---

<section class="section final-section">
  <article class="final-card reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Closing Note</p>
    <h2>ここまで育ててくれたことへの感謝を、結果と行動で返していく</h2>
    <p>
      今回の進路選択は、これまで支えてもらったことの延長線上にあります。
      残りの学生生活を謳歌し、社会人になってからも自分が幸せであるために周囲を幸せにできるような価値を提供し続けて、恩返します。
    </p>
    <div class="signature-wrap">
      <img src={publicAsset('mysign.svg')} alt="吉川泰生のサイン" class="signature-img" />
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<footer class="footer-refs reveal">
  <div style="max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto;">
    <p style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--accent-3); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;">Sources</p>
    <div class="ref-list">
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-3">3. Accenture Fact Sheet (Q2 2026): <a href="https://newsroom.accenture.com/fact-sheet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://newsroom.accenture.com/fact-sheet</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-7">7. Financial Performance / Annual Report 2025: <a href="https://investor.accenture.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://investor.accenture.com/</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-15">15. Accenture Annual Report 2025: <a href="https://www.accenture.com/content/dam/accenture/final/accenture-com/document-4/Annual-Report-2025.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source PDF</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-17">17. $3B AI Bet Strategy: <a href="https://www.crn.com/news/ai/2025/accenture-s-3b-ai-bet-is-paying-off-inside-a-massive-transformation-fueled-by-advanced-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CRN Analysis</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-18">18. Technology Vision 2025: <a href="https://www.accenture.com/us-en/insights/technology/technology-vision-2025" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Accenture Tech Vision</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-24">24. Google Cloud Partnership: <a href="https://newsroom.accenture.com/news/2026/accenture-and-google-cloud-expand-partnership-to-scale-agentic-transformation-for-global-enterprises-with-gemini-enterprise" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Newsroom</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-27">27-28. Reinvention Growth Model: <a href="https://newsroom.accenture.com/news/2025/accenture-changes-growth-model-to-reinvent-itself-for-the-age-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Accenture News</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-37">37-42. Project PRIDE (Japan): <a href="https://www.accenture.com/jp-ja/about/company/project-pride" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.accenture.com/jp-ja/about/company/project-pride</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-54">54-56. Job Levels at Accenture: <a href="https://iq.opengenus.org/job-levels-at-accenture/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Career Structure Guide</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-62">62. Talent & Education Investment: <a href="https://www.accenture.com/us-en/about/company/integrated-reporting-talent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Talent Development</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-64">64. Brand Finance IT Services 2025: <a href="https://brandirectory.com/reports/it-services/2025" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Brand Report</a></div>
      <div class="ref-item" id="ref-71">71. Accenture Firm Overview: <a href="https://www.casebasix.com/pages/accenture-firm-overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CaseBasix Analysis</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
